@startuml 01-contexto-sistema
' Context view (black-box style)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam rectangle {
  roundCorner 10
}
title Context view — IoT Monitoring System\n(DHT22 temperature / humidity)

actor "Operator / team\n(stakeholder)" as Ops
actor "Vehicle / bench\n(PiCarX: 5G Quectel RM520N-GL,\nWi-Fi fallback)" as Edge
actor "ESP32 device\n(Wi-Fi and/or LoRa, optional)" as Esp

rectangle "IoT Monitoring System\n(repo: iot_monitoring)" as Sys #E8F4FC {
}

Ops --> Sys : browses dashboards & history\n(web browser)
Edge --> Sys : sends HTTP readings (publisher)
Esp --> Sys : sends HTTP readings (firmware / ingest)

note right of Sys
  The system exposes a REST API and a web UI.
  Local persistence: SQLite on the API server.
end note

@enduml
